  "tree_stacey": {
    "text_1": "WOC — THE NETWORK · THE TREE",
    "text_2": "Stacey Lanier",
    "text_3": "Teacher to Teachers · Clinical Supervision · Professional Consultation",
    "text_4": "Strengthening the people who guide others.",
    "text_5": "Meet Stacey, founder of Calm Minds Healing Collective. Her Tree branch is for teachers, clinicians, practitioners, and organizations seeking professional learning and stronger capacity to support others.",
    "text_6": "Discuss professional learning →",
    "text_7": "Clinical depth. A wider reach.",
    "text_8": "Her website describes more than three decades of clinical experience and work informed by trauma, nervous system regulation, hypnosis, EMDR, and Brainspotting. On The Tree, the focus is the knowledge she can share with professionals who teach, lead, and guide others.",
    "text_9": "Licensed Professional Counselor",
    "text_10": "Approved Clinical Supervisor",
    "text_11": "EMDR Approved Consultant",
    "text_12": "Founder of Truth Empowered Counseling &amp; Wellness",
    "text_13": "Co-founder of The Atelier wellness co-working space",
    "text_14": "PROFESSIONAL CONVERSATIONS TO BEGIN",
    "text_15": "Find the right learning connection.",
    "text_16": "Clinical supervision",
    "text_17": "Ask about supervision for clinicians, professional development goals, eligibility, and the states or settings she can serve.",
    "text_18": "EMDR consultation",
    "text_19": "Ask about professional consultation and support for practitioners developing their EMDR work. Confirm prerequisites and any credential-related requirements directly.",
    "text_20": "Workshops &amp; organizational learning",
    "text_21": "Her site lists workshops and organizational consulting. Ask about trauma-informed practice, resilience, leadership support, and your team's professional learning needs.",
    "text_22": "Stacey confirms the available scope, format, dates, fees, and any certification or continuing education requirements directly.",
    "text_23": "STORY → WISDOM → APPLICATION",
    "text_24": "When the guide grows, the reach grows.",
    "text_25": "Name one area where the people doing the teaching or helping need more support. What learning would help them serve with greater clarity?",
    "text_26": "Bring a useful question to Stacey",
    "text_27": "“Our team works with [audience]. We want to strengthen [skill or practice]. What professional learning or consultation would fit our needs?”",
    "text_28": "CONNECT DIRECTLY",
    "text_29": "Talk with Stacey about professional learning.",
    "text_30": "Tell her who you teach, lead, or support—and what you want your team to learn.",
